# Captured Emby responses are verified by hashing their raw bytes against
# tests/artifacts/emby/<version>/manifest.json, so any line-ending conversion
# changes the file's identity and fails the check. Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrite LF to CRLF, which is enough to break all 35 of
# them while Linux CI stays green.
#
# -text disables that conversion for these paths only. Deliberately narrow:
# a repo-wide `text=auto` would renormalise every tracked file at once.
tests/artifacts/** -text
